{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_crow_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_crow_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"堅韌的羽毛","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_crow_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"21d6a27802c059eda55a1d44e4d0c6ba302e1c917240ad0d7d3f49e764ea3436","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"美女，別等了，這家武器店已經關門了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"你是來觀光的吧，這家武器店過去在多索雷斯有點名氣，店主能搞到很多別人搞不到的好貨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"但是已經很久沒開門了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這我也知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，美女，沒想到，你居然還挺了解多索雷斯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，有一件事你肯定不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"多索雷斯是個寸土寸金的地方，而這家店的地段這麼好，一般是不可能關了這麼久還沒被轉租的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"但這家店關了快一年了，依然沒有被轉租。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道是為什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事可是個不小的秘密，一般人是不知道的，你要是感興趣的話，來我的店裡買一束花，我就告訴你，怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為這家店的店主和坎黛拉市長的關係不一般。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"……這你也知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抓小偷啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去幫忙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"她的動作好輕盈，就像是……一片羽毛一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犯罪分子","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，看來今天收獲不少。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"站住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犯罪分子","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼人？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把搶的東西還回去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犯罪分子","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犯罪分子","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為條子什麼時候這麼有效率了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犯罪分子","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"原來是個小姑娘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犯罪分子","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，你的爸爸媽媽沒有教過你，在多索雷斯，隨便逞英雄是會死……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"犯罪分子話還沒有說完，羽毛筆就已經欺身靠近，猛地將他手中的刀打落在地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犯罪分子","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"咕啊啊啊啊啊啊！我的手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的媽媽在我很小的時候就死了，我的兩個爸爸都告訴我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做壞事是要受到懲罰的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把東西交出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犯罪分子","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犯罪分子","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"別以為自己身手還不錯就了不起了，小姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犯罪分子","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是多索雷斯，多的是在這裡扎根的勢力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……為什麼，你會吹這個口哨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是真正玻利瓦爾人之間傳訊的手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犯罪分子","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"……你到底是什麼人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是個……路人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犯罪分子","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，不管你是誰，你馬上就會知道，你惹了惹不起的人……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"我應該教過你，不要隨便用這個訊號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"坎黛拉的人時時刻刻都在盯著我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犯罪分子","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，老大，我遇到了點麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犯罪分子","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來已經得手了，但是被這個小姑娘攔住……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……塔吉克叔叔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"拉菲艾拉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"都放下吧，是自己人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犯罪分子","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"拉菲艾拉……難道說，她是上校的女兒？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼，叔叔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我來吧，拉菲艾拉，說來話長了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偷來的東西要還回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"聽你的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是跟著埃內斯托一起去了那個羅德島，怎麼又回來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我請了個假，想回來探望爸爸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，原來如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不認識剛才那個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"他……是我新收的手下，你不認識也很正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔吉克叔叔，我以為你們已經離開多索雷斯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"……不少人在上校被捕之後確實離開了，但他老人家總歸需要人照顧，我和其他一些人就留了下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在騙我，塔吉克叔叔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你的性格，你以前連其他人打牌要賭錢都會說兩句，現在怎麼可能突然放任手下的人去做這種事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說那個扒手是新來的，但是他知道爸爸的軍銜，你在說謊，他根本不是新來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有這間房間……火藥的味道，很重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要重新組建一支隊伍，然後去救爸爸，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"居然能閃開我的擒拿……身手長進了不少啊，拉菲艾拉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巴羅叔叔？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉啊，拉菲艾拉，此路不通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"你聰明了不少，以前你的觀察力沒有這麼敏銳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"本來，我只是想招待你一下就讓你離開的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，你的假期恐怕要延長幾天了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，我的假期還不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不是為了阻止你們來的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"……你是我看著長大的，我要是有女兒，我一定會希望她和你一樣乖巧，拉菲艾拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，在我們完成目標之前，我不能讓你離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"別怪我無情，拉菲艾拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"從你跟著埃內斯托離開的那一刻起，你就不算在我們這一邊了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你們打算怎麼做？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"和以前沒什麼區別，滲透、襲擊、爆破，最好能在坎黛拉臉上開道口子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"別學埃內斯托那小子擺出一副“難道就沒有別的辦法了嗎”的表情，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道嗎，何塞死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"巴羅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"她有權知道，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"但這個蠢貨不是死在戰鬥中，他是死於賭博。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"坎黛拉是個怪物，她一手打造的這座城市是個怪物，我們現在惹不起她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"等我們救出上校，我們就離開這座城市。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我也來幫忙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"你好不容易找到那麼好的工作，沒必要來跟我們蹚渾水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"你只需要在這裡待到我們的事情結束就可以安全離開。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不能就這樣袖手旁觀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"算了吧，塔吉克，你打算裝到什麼時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"這孩子雖然聽話，但可不是誰的話都願意聽的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"這可是我們所有弟兄的女兒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是羅德島的人，他們不會太為難我，我來幫你們和爸爸接觸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧瞧，我們的女兒長大了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"我們回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"看，上好的羽獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"還有你要的調味料和其他一些食材也都買來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廚房我也清掃好了，接下來就交給我吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我們兩個粗人不懂廚藝，要是有什麼要幫忙的儘管使喚我們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，真虧你想得到，烤羽獸，上校最愛吃的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"經過人工養殖的可食用羽獸體型都比較大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"我們完全可以把想要傳遞的訊息寫在紙條上，塞在裡面，由你交給上校。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定還能塞一些小玩意進去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我也想讓爸爸久違地吃到愛吃的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在裡面肯定沒怎麼好好吃東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"……是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"上校本來就是不愛享受的性格，在監獄裡肯定過得也不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"能吃到女兒做的烤羽獸，他老人家肯定樂壞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"上校知道你有這份心肯定也是高興的，畢竟……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"巴羅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"行，我不該提。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥哥他……前陣子回來過。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"他去探望了上校，還去參加了什麼婚禮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"我遠遠地看了他一眼，沒去找他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們討厭哥哥嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"討厭？怎麼會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"上校被捕的時候，不是他出面，我們所有人可能已經被埋在外面的荒野上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"他是個有前途的小子，說不定以後他真的能出人頭地呢，呵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巴羅叔叔，把那個香料遞給我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在火焰的炙烤下，羽獸肉逐漸擁有了美麗的光澤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖，這個香味，真是讓人懷念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"……是啊，我們還沒來多索雷斯的時候，在野外就經常聚在一起烤肉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然沒有這麼好的廚具，也沒有這麼豐富的香料，肉也是打獵來的，柴得很……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"但是生起火，弟兄們圍在火堆邊上，就會覺得，再大的苦都挨得過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"……誰說不是呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"塔吉克，接著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"你什麼時候買的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"就在剛才。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼沒發現？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"要是讓你發現了，我這個偵察兵不是白當了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"強壯的士兵沒有多言，只是打開罐裝酒，猛地灌了一口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也要。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"羽毛筆稍顯笨拙地拉開拉環，雙手捧著罐子，小口小口地喝了起來。\n士兵們喝酒從來不講究品質，這酒的味道和她親手調的比起來簡直是天壤之別。\n但這刺激的口感，卻一瞬間讓她回憶起了從前。\n她想起有一次，爸爸打了勝仗，所有人在營地裡慶祝。\n那時她已經學會了做飯，她也很喜歡給這些叔叔做飯。\n哥哥喜歡安靜的地方，於是躲在帳篷裡睡覺。\n但最後被他們吵得沒辦法，想要去制止，卻被爸爸硬拉著喝酒，最後兩個人都喝醉了。\n營地裡充滿了歡聲笑語。\n那時，爸爸經常會開懷大笑。\n那時，哥哥的心事總是寫在臉上。\n……\n烤肉冒出的滋滋聲將她拉回現實。\n她忽然有些感謝博士。\n要是放在過去，她一定會糾結於自己該怎麼做，希望有一個人能給她出主意。\n但是現在，她早就想好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客？","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客？","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客？","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客？","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，跟丟了，不過，她去的方向是監獄，應該是要和潘喬接觸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客？","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，她和潘喬的殘部接觸過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客？","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，很可能有這層關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客？","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"調集人手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這種時候，真想聽博士誇一誇我呀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cellroomA"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸，我來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，我的孩子，好孩子，你終於來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸，我還給你帶了這個，你最愛吃的烤羽獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"齁齁，我女兒做的烤羽獸，這真是很久沒有吃到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過來，讓我好好看看你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比之前稍微瘦了一點，是不是羅德島的伙食不太好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，羅德島的伙食可好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是最近出的任務有點多了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別太累著自己，規律的作息和飲食很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸，你身上的傷痕變多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，監獄是用拳頭說話的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過是告訴了一些人，上了年紀的老東西也不是那麼好欺負的罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我下次給你帶一些藥膏來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得，羅德島這個地方怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得……蠻好的，公司裡的人都很友善，而且待遇也不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，為別人打工總是沒個著落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島不是在各個國家之間到處跑嗎？你跟著他們走的時候也自己留意一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有適合的地方，就在那裡扎根吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能回玻利瓦爾嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……傻孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玻利瓦爾沒什麼好的。我現在最大的心願，就是你能平平安安的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那哥哥呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個臭小子……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他想要做事，那就去做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事到如今，他就算和我說，他想要給坎黛拉看門，我也不會反對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他永遠想不清楚，自己究竟想要什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"猶猶豫豫，瞻前顧後，這樣的人怎麼能成事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得……哥哥不是沒有想清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥哥是知道自己想要什麼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他只是在害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"害怕？他能害怕什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥哥害怕失去，他害怕當他真的選擇了某一條道路的時候，他會失去爸爸，會失去我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你是這麼認為的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在羅德島上，哥哥其實很少和我說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥哥的想法，大概和爸爸你一樣，希望我能藉由羅德島找到自己的歸宿吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是……為什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是在玻利瓦爾長大的，為什麼只有我應該離開這裡，而你們就不應該離開呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸，之前的叛亂，我也參與其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不是無辜的那一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你本來不應該被捲進來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我不願意眼睜睜地看著這一切發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，就算我眼睜睜地看著這一切發生了……我真的就能夠置身事外了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我越是去想這些問題，我就越困惑——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我也越發地理解了哥哥，理解了爸爸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想要做些什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這份烤羽獸，是我和塔吉克叔叔他們一起做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔吉克……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個混帳東西，就算情況很糟糕，他也不該去找你來做這件事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我主動要幫忙的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，很多事情很複雜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我想要去弄懂，可我還沒有弄得太懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，有一件事我是明白的，爸爸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能讓那些尊敬你、愛戴你的人白白為你送死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以……你希望我不要收下這份烤羽獸，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次，我會給你做更好吃的食物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你長這麼大以來，第二次對我提要求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你長大了，拉菲艾拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們都這麼說，但是，我感覺自己和以前沒有什麼區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望爸爸身體健康，我希望哥哥少做危險的事，就這麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃內斯托那小子之前來過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他問我，記不記得我和他母親第一次見面時，她胸口別著的那朵花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說，我忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是，我變老了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是紫丁香。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？你怎麼會……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你告訴我的呀，爸爸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那天，她把喝得爛醉的爸爸扶回帳篷，爸爸拉著她迷迷糊糊地說話。\n說著說著，爸爸就哭了。\n因為爸爸想到了他的妻子。\n想到了他和妻子初遇時，她胸口的那朵花。\n紫丁香，一朵美麗的紫丁香。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊，是紫丁香。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼會忘了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把這隻烤羽獸帶回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……真的可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉菲艾拉，我的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原以為有些話我只會和埃內斯托說，沒想到，這些話也有對你說的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當你決定去做一件事，就不要畏首畏尾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"絕不要被別人的想法左右。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你會把對哥哥說的話告訴我……那麼，你會把對我說的話告訴哥哥嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要答應我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我答應你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"都準備了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"三十個，一個不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"你說，拉菲艾拉願不願意跟我們一起走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"……別傻了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰之前不想把她捲進來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我們這群明天不知道就會死在哪的人一起根本沒有好處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"你還想明天死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"我看，今天就差不多了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"拉菲艾拉，你回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"上校他還好嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，爸爸他還是老樣子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你的手上……你怎麼把烤羽獸帶回來了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是爸爸的答覆。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"這不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"上校不可能甘心待在監獄裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"……丫頭，你騙了我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"你是去說服上校的，是嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坎黛拉的手下一直在盯著你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不希望你們白白送死。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"……你還是那麼善良，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"但我說過了，我們沒有多少機會了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_193","isRemote":false,"text":"讓開，孩子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不能過去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"narration","text":"領頭者向身後的同伴點了點頭，示意準備突擊。\n這裡是潘喬殘部的據點，根據密報，他們打算密謀營救潘喬。\n女士的意思是，格殺勿論。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）三，二，一——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"——嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"坎黛拉的手下們愣了一下。\n房間中只有躺倒在地呻吟的士兵，以及一個站在房間中央的女孩。\n女孩拿著巨大的鐮刀，鐮刀反射著懾人的寒光，而寒光照到她的臉上，卻照出兩道淚痕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，我們進來的時候就已經是這樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是埃內斯托的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是羅德島的幹員，代號羽毛筆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的幹員……怎麼會在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這群士兵私藏軍火被我偶然發現，所以我就出手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我們多索雷斯的私事，在你發現的時候，就應該告訴我的手下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，坎黛拉女士，事發突然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也很抱歉，孩子，這個理由，不夠充分。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"坎黛拉話音未落，身後的手下們已經舉起武器對準了羽毛筆。\n就在這時——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……呵呵，原來如此，我知道了，我很快就會回來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我改變主意了，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是個不錯的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把這些人都帶回去，對他們好一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"女士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的一位老朋友忽然主動提出想要和我聊一聊，我現在心情很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"跟上，把這些地上的雜碎都帶走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉手下們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很勇敢，孩子，你為他們贏得了活下去的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在想什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想，我應該感謝你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前，埃內斯托告訴我他有個很乖的妹妹，我沒有在意，現在看來，他對你的評價失之偏頗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道嗎，孩子，你不該出手的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你最正確的做法，是看著這一切發生，然後轉身離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還年輕，你有離開玻利瓦爾的權利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你今天做的這一切，雖然救下了一些人，但是，也讓我記住了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被我記住不是一件好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我認真考慮過了，我是自己決定這麼做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的哥哥對我說，長在玻利瓦爾這個國家上的尖刺，是他唯一的喜樂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，你怎麼想，孩子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哥哥，他對於玻利瓦爾的事想了很多很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一開始也想要變得和哥哥一樣，但我發現，我做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想得更多的，永遠是我身邊的親人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使你們沒有血脈相連？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使我們沒有血脈相連，我永遠是哥哥的妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也永遠是爸爸的女兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他們不打算離開，那麼，我也不應該離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就這麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你讓我想起了我接手這座城市的時候，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的父親是個混蛋，這座城市是他留下的爛攤子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有能力去改造它，可是為什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說，是為什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……因為你也是你爸爸的女兒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有這麼簡單，但也沒有那麼複雜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總有一天，你會明白的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是被狂風捲起的羽毛，風暴會無情地摧殘你……可如果你足夠堅韌，也會看見只能在風暴之中窺見的景色。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"美女，既然你都知道這家店不會開了，你為什麼又在這裡發呆呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"我是之前和你搭話的人，你忘了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"……好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，這個給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"你之前不是幫忙抓了一個小偷嗎，失主想要給你謝禮，但是找不到你人，最後找到我這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道你在哪，但我想你既然對這裡這麼了解，可能還會再來，就擅自幫你保管了下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……啊，你是那天和我搭話的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛才就這麼說了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼又在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我開的花店就在這附近啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"花店？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"對，我曾經是一個參加極限賽的運動員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"有一天，我在賽場上摔倒了，當所有人對我發出噓聲的時候，我卻看到一朵花，那朵花彷彿在對我微笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我乾脆退出了體育界，開了這家店。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，等等我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你這裡有紫丁香嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要買一束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"花店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"是要送人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽毛筆","speakerId":"avg_421_crow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，送給我的家人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
